## Heapify

Heapify is used to convert a subtree into a valid heap.

Time Complexity: O(log n)

---

## Build Heap

Starting from the last non-leaf node:

```cpp
for(int i=n/2; i>=1; i--)
{
    heapify(arr,n,i);
}
```

Time Complexity: O(n)

---

## Heap Sort

Steps:

1. Build Max Heap
2. Swap root with last element
3. Reduce heap size
4. Heapify root
5. Repeat

Time Complexity: O(n log n)

Space Complexity: O(1)

